  "bodyHash": "9563d9ae380207b1",
  "content": "\n\n![開放測試圖片](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/70113b21dc0f11446272bb488a42316a88251037.png)\nHysentials 是一款為 Hypixel 設計的內容擴充與便利性（QOL）模組。它提供了豐富的新功能，例如住房的動作庫與社團、帶有外觀獎勵的自訂等級系統、獨特的選單與階級重新設計、表情符號等，還有更多驚喜！\n\n## 功能特色\n<details>\n    <summary>綠寶石</summary>\n    <h3>綠寶石</h3>\n    <p>Hysentials 使用綠寶石作為主要貨幣，用於購買模組提供的各種商品，例如外觀道具、任務重擲、進階功能以及交易！</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>獲取綠寶石</strong> - 在 Hypixel 遊玩小遊戲可賺取少量綠寶石，或前往我們的 <a href=\"https://www.redstone.llc/store\">線上商店</a> 購買。</li>\n        <li><strong>衣櫃外觀</strong> - 按下預設快捷鍵「K」即可開啟外觀衣櫃（此快捷鍵可在模組設定中透過 R-SHIFT 修改）。</li>\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1ad7539bf4a8760605735efa0260bc1ec14b213b.png\" alt=\"衣櫃介面\">\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n    <summary>Hysentials 等級系統</summary>\n    <h3>Hysentials 等級系統</h3>\n    <p>這個僅限用戶端的等級系統會獎勵玩家專屬外觀與綠寶石！遊玩時累積經驗值（EXP）並解鎖獎勵。以下為部分獲得經驗值的方式：</p>\n    <details open=\"\">\n        <summary>獲取 HXP</summary>\n        <ul>\n            <li><strong>遊玩時間</strong> - 只要在使用 Hysentials 的情況下於 Hypixel 遊玩，每小時即可賺取 200-400 EXP。</li>\n            <li><strong>小遊戲勝利</strong> - 每贏得一場小遊戲即可獲得經驗值。詳細分配如下：</li>\n            <details>\n                <summary>單場勝利經驗值</summary>\n                <table style=\"width: 400px\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>遊戲</th>\n                        <th>單場勝利經驗值</th>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Arcade</td>\n                        <td>200-300 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Bedwars</td>\n                        <td>250 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Blitz</td>\n                        <td>250 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Build Battle</td>\n                        <td>150 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Cops vs Crims</td>\n                        <td>150 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Duels</td>\n                        <td>75 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Mega Walls</td>\n                        <td>250 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Murder Mystery</td>\n                        <td>250 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Paintball</td>\n                        <td>225 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Quakecraft</td>\n                        <td>225 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Skywars</td>\n                        <td>150 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Smash Heroes</td>\n                        <td>225 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Speed UHC</td>\n                        <td>250 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Turbo Cart Racers</td>\n                        <td>225 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>TNT Games</td>\n                        <td>300 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>UHC</td>\n                        <td>500 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>VampireZ</td>\n                        <td>225 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Walls</td>\n                        <td>375 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Warlords</td>\n                        <td>250 EXP</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n            </details>\n        </ul>\n    </details>\n    <details open=\"\">\n        <summary>等級選單</summary>\n        <p>輸入 <code>/hysentials level</code> 即可開啟等級選單。在此可查看您的等級、經驗值以及晉升下一級的進度。</p>\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/18017406ef6286d3b1fe61dec0cd63abcbd7b479.png\" alt=\"Hysentials 等級選單\">\n    </details>\n</details>",
